---
// Not found, Hebrew subtree (/he/404) — specs/pages/not-found.md §5.
// Same minimal composition, rendered lang="he" dir="rtl" from the locale;
// its two links point at /he/writing/ and / (Hebrew target first).
// The eyebrow's `404` segment renders under the Hebrew stack: no
// text-transform, letter-spacing normal (navigation.md §3.2).
//
// The row of links is RoutesOut + RouteOutLink. This page's scoped <style>
// block was byte-identical to /404's, and both were byte-identical to what
// those two components already emit — which is what licensed deleting them
// both. The reasoning for the row's values lives in RoutesOut.astro and
// RouteOutLink.astro. The edge, the padding after it and the row's gaps are
// all bound on the inline axis, so they flip with dir="rtl" here and nothing
// on this page has to restate them for RTL.
//
// /404 is the same composition in the other locale (not-found.md §5) and the
// two must not drift, so the markup below is written to match it line for
// line: same components, same order, same three utilities on the paragraph.
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import RoutesOut from '../../components/RoutesOut.astro';
import RouteOutLink from '../../components/RouteOutLink.astro';
---

{/* REVIEW(Tal): drafted Hebrew, not native-checked. It is a statement, not a
    joke — the Hebrew 404 recovers a visitor exactly like the English one. */}
<Base
  title="404 · T://bendet"
  description="אין עמוד בכתובת הזו."
  section="404"
  sectionLang="he"
>
  {/* `.statement` was three declarations — --size-lede, --text, and a 44ch
      measure — and it is three utilities, not a component. Extracting a
      component for three utilities would cost an import and a file to keep
      the same string in one place, which is what writing it identically on
      both pages already does. The identical string is on /404's paragraph;
      if one of them changes the other changes with it. The 44ch measure is a
      character count, so it holds under the Hebrew stack without adjustment. */}
  <p class="text-size-lede text-text max-inline-[44ch]">אין עמוד בכתובת הזו.</p>

  <RoutesOut>
    <RouteOutLink href="/he/writing/">תרגומים</RouteOutLink>
    <RouteOutLink href="/" lang="en">home</RouteOutLink>
  </RoutesOut>
</Base>
